- **`GetAllConsiliumSessions`** (lines 96-135): Queries all registered workDir variants (for Windows case-sensitivity), deduplicates by `session.id`, then merges Think sessions from `listThinkSessions()`.
- **`GetRegisteredWorkDirs`** (lines 137-139): Returns registered work dirs for the workspace.
- **`SetWorkDir`** (lines 141-151): Sets the custom work directory (must be within workspace root).
- **`BrowseWorkDir`** (lines 153-212): QuickPick + open dialog to select a subdirectory as the working directory.
- **`LoadConsiliumSessionHistory`** (lines 214-329): The main session history loader — handles both Think (`.jsonl`) and Do (wire events via SDK) session paths. Includes safety checks for UUID format, Windows case-sensitivity, crash recovery (appends `history_restored` event if last event is non-terminal).
- **`DeleteConsiliumSession`** (lines 331-336): Deletes a session via SDK.
- **`ForkConsiliumSession`** (lines 338-352): Forks a session at a given turn index via SDK.
- **`WriteSessionMetadata`** (lines 354-369): Persists session title/metadata and broadcasts `SessionTitleUpdated` event.
- **`RestoreTabState`** (lines 371-373): Returns restored tab state.

